WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.510
"You can't beat me, Sid!" Rex said.

2
00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:17.051
Rex and Sid were racing.

3
00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:20.756
They ran through the forest.

4
00:00:20.757 --> 00:00:24.479
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

5
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.873
Sid ran after Rex.

6
00:00:27.874 --> 00:00:34.896
Rex ran past a big rock.

7
00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:40.341
Sid tried to run fast.

8
00:00:40.342 --> 00:00:44.343
"I'm going to win!"

9
00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:55.659
Rex ran faster. "No way!"

10
00:00:55.660 --> 00:01:02.371
A small dino ran too.

11
00:01:02.372 --> 00:01:05.852
She ran along branches.

12
00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:09.576
The small dino watched the race.

13
00:01:09.577 --> 00:01:13.361
"That looks fun!" she thought.

14
00:01:13.362 --> 00:01:19.113
Sid ran ahead of Rex.

15
00:01:19.114 --> 00:01:31.264
"I'm right behind you!" Rex said.

16
00:01:31.265 --> 00:01:33.730
Sid ran past trees.

17
00:01:33.731 --> 00:01:38.632
His tail swung.

18
00:01:38.633 --> 00:01:41.459
It almost hit a tree.

19
00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.986
The small dino jumped.

20
00:01:43.987 --> 00:01:46.632
She landed on another branch.

21
00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:48.651
The branch shook.

22
00:01:48.652 --> 00:01:52.722
Acorns dropped.

23
00:01:52.723 --> 00:01:57.100
One acorn hit Rex. Bonk!

24
00:01:57.101 --> 00:01:59.825
Rex got mad.

25
00:01:59.826 --> 00:02:05.098
"That hurt, Sid!"

